      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 29,
      "label": "coach_teacher_home_sp03_04",
      "hash64": "8C60D4B9C310023A",
      "text": "C’est bien cela, m[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0707)]on chera chère [VAR 0x0100(0000)].\\nBravo ! Aurais-tu déjà essayé, par hasard ?[VAR 0x0114(0029)]",
